# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MEMBER PERSONAL DATA — never commit any of this.
#
# The spreadsheets hold hundreds of families' phone numbers, ages and home
# addresses. The live data belongs in Supabase, not in a code repository. The
# spreadsheet stays on the committee's own machine as a local import source.
# This file exists BEFORE the folder is a git repository on purpose, so the
# first `git add` can never pick the sheet up by accident.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
.data/

# Secrets — the Supabase service key lives here. Never commit.
# Every .env variant is ignored, but the placeholder template stays tracked so
# a future maintainer can see which variables the app needs.
.env*
!.env.local.example

# Vercel CLI local state
.vercel

# Design-pass screenshot output
.screenshots/
